# These are dev-only / documentation / one-off operational scripts that are
# never imported by the Next.js app (src/, public/, prisma/ schema +
# migrations) and are not needed to run `next build` or `next start`.
# See Docs/deployment/VERCEL_USAGE_CONTROLS.md for context.

